  nodeId: CO - Page 3
  speakerName: 
  lineText: "<b>Visuals</b>\r\nBackstage at the convention hall \u2014 moments after
    Thomas steps off the stage, trophy still in hand. His phone buzzes. His hands
    start shaking as he answers.\r\n\r\n<b>Narrative</b>\r\nA voice bursts through
    in panicked, breathless tears: \"Thomas. The police are here\u2026 you need to
    come back.\" Thomas sprints out of the convention hall.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<i>No.
    of Panels: 3</i>\r\n<i>1. Phone Ringing</i>\r\n<i>2. Dialogue</i>\r\n<i>3. Hand
    Shakes</i>\r\n\r"
